    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Vaccination information dissemination and monitoring systems strengthened. 
Indicator: By 2024, sex-disaggregated age-appropriate immunization data included in annual national health reports 
Achievement: Y 
Progress/Status: 2b) Sex-disaggregated data not available for routine EPI data but available for COVID-19 immunization data.  

EPI routine program is in the process of including sex disaggregated data as a routine quality strengthening initiative. But this is not completed as yet.
 
Data Source: Epidemiology Unit, VIMS records 
